  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby approved is that which is shown in the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>- DRAWING XXX REV XX DATED XX<br>- USE [SHIFT]+[ENTER] FOR REGULAR LINE SPACING<br>- USE [ENTER] FOR LARGER LINE SPACING</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "\r\n Within 3 months from the date of this consent,\r\n     full details of cycle parking facilities shall be submitted to and\r\n     approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. This shall\r\n     demonstrate that the cycle parking is in compliance with Policy T5 of the\r\n     London Plan and meets the requirements of the London Cycling Design\r\n     Standards (LCDS).Once approved, the\r\n     approved details shall be fully implemented within 3 months of that date. Thereafter, the cycle parking\r\n     facilities shall be permanently retained.\r\n",
    "Within 3 months from the date of this consent, a refuse\r\nmanagement plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local\r\nPlanning Authority. Thereafter the approved management plan shall be\r\nimplemented in accordance with the approved details.",
    "No\r\npart of the extension hereby approved shall be used as a balcony or any other\r\nform of external amenity space."
  ],
